---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Panel from '../components/Panel.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import image from '../assets/bandphoto2022adjusted2.jpg';
---
<Layout title="About" description="Tinker's Damn — grunge, stoner, and psych rock from Colorado Springs. Courtney, Shawn, Andy, and Rob.">
    <Panel tone="paper">
        <div class="sec-label"><span class="label">Who's Tinker's Damn</span><span class="line"></span></div>
        <h1 class="misreg">Grungy Grooves On The Rocks</h1>
        <div class="bio-grid">
            <div class="bio">
                <p><strong>Tinker's Damn</strong> has been rocking Colorado Springs since 2014. During the pandemic downtime, what started out as a cover band evolved into a group producing original music — a cross between Clutch and The Pretty Reckless.</p>
                <p>Fronted by <strong>Courtney's</strong> killer and versatile vocals, with <strong>Shawn</strong> ripping out the guitar solos. The rhythm section grooves on the bass of <strong>Andy</strong> while <strong>Rob</strong> holds down the backbeat on drums.</p>
                <p>Our debut album <em>From the Depths of Earl Drive</em> is out now.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bio-photo">
                <Image src={image} alt="Band photo of the members of Tinker's Damn in a brewroom"/>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Panel>
</Layout>

<style>
    .bio-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 2.25rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .bio p { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; max-width: 52ch; }
    .bio-photo { justify-self: center; transform: rotate(-1.5deg); }
    .bio-photo :global(img) { border: 8px solid #fff; box-shadow: 8px 10px 0 rgba(20, 17, 15, 0.22); display: block; }
    @media (max-width: 820px) { .bio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .bio-photo { margin-top: 1.25rem; justify-self: start; } }
</style>
